f_{a b c}=\frac{2}{i \hbar^{3}} \operatorname{Tr}\left\{\left[\hat{T}_{a}, \hat{T}_{b}\right] \hat{T}_{c}\right\} \equiv \frac{1}{4 i} \operatorname{Tr}\left\{\left[\hat{\lambda}_{a}, \hat{\lambda}_{b}\right] \hat{\lambda}_{c}\right\}
